#
# Every minute: the connections already open to an address one of this plugin's lists has just
# gained are cut (cut.py, when "Cut open connections" is on), and the TLS connections whose client
# shows a listed JA4 fingerprint are cut, the log read every two seconds through the minute
# (ja4_cut.py). With nothing to watch, each reads config.xml once and exits.

* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/cut.py > /dev/null 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/ja4_cut.py --for 58 > /dev/null 2>&1
